<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Donna Karan EPS cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Donna Karan EPS cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney cut earnings estimates on Donna Karan International Inc but maintained its outperform rating, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- The source said the analyst cut shares earnings estimates to $0.83 from $0.99 for 1996, to $1.20 from $1.57 for 1997 and to $1.80 from $1.95 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 3-1/8 to 15-5/8.</p>
</text>
